{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120144","id":3839612269,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7k29Vt","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120144","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120144.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120144.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120144","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120144/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120144/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120144/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/da1ebd344bb4130eb6afeb565e19715afccbe8b8","number":120144,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix GLES3 sky rendering on legacy Adreno GPUs","user":{"login":"summeryy001","id":82246595,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyMjQ2NTk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82246595?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/summeryy001","html_url":"https://github.com/summeryy001","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/summeryy001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/summeryy001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/summeryy001/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/summeryy001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/summeryy001/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/summeryy001/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/summeryy001/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/summeryy001/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/summeryy001/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Legacy Adreno GPUs up to Adreno 510 can crash in the GLES3 sky radiance draw path when using the Compatibility renderer. Avoid using the sky radiance map in the scene shader path on affected devices, draw the sky before opaque geometry, and keep a small ambient fallback so scenes remain visible when sky radiance is unavailable. This mitigates crashes similar to godotengine/godot#75507 and was tested on a Xiaomi Max with Adreno 510 running Android 7.0.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n\r\nMitigates godotengine/godot#75507.\r\n\r\nLegacy Adreno GPUs up to Adreno 510 can crash in the GLES3 sky radiance draw path when using the Compatibility renderer.\r\n\r\nThis workaround:\r\n- Detects Adreno GPUs up to Adreno 510.\r\n- Avoids using the sky radiance map in the GLES3 scene shader path on affected devices.\r\n- Draws the sky before opaque geometry on affected devices.\r\n- Keeps a small ambient fallback so scenes remain visible when sky radiance is unavailable.\r\n\r\nTested on:\r\n- Xiaomi Max\r\n- Android 7.0\r\n- Qualcomm Adreno (TM) 510\r\n- Compatibility / GLES3 renderer\r\n\r\nWithout this workaround, the app crashes in `/system/vendor/lib64/egl/libGLESv2_adreno.so` around the GLES3 scene draw path. With this workaround, the same project runs without crashing, the sky remains visible, and both 3D and 2D rendering work correctly.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097562,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:android","name":"platform:android","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/own